{"job_id":"F-8e003f724053fc6cff01","family_id":"F-8e003f724053fc6cff01","title":"중국산 폴리에스테르 장섬유 완전연신사(FDY)에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":46,"target_id":"932089b2ae40ab7871fcf3fd2458541539489f00779812c28c32dc6d935eb920","source_hash":"d2de63e314d3791613c65cbfdbcc268fc450b1e484b762bc67df54fe08da10bb","text":"关于对中国产全拉伸聚酯长丝（FDY）征收反倾销税的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"b348c18a635594897068beee25d890d22a11406473c82031cd246561c768a321","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":247,"target_id":"12b00161e1f3d2dc81addbeef952adec7d0c0cbd9f866a6785e78e121eb9fbb8","source_hash":"a3ca5e729fcc694831340c95ba130dbaddf6a25e46c0d3cb079c44679b856f22","text":"第二条（征税对象）根据《海关法实施令》第九十八条第一款的规定，对原产于中国的、税号为5402.47.9000的涤纶长丝全拉伸纱（FDY）征收反倾销税。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":247,"end":322,"target_id":"ad7e10bb316d1c9bd3b6692c38246c0df623f6ee2fc0723074eccbe361797946","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":322,"end":343,"target_id":"799984a9c12c4738e168d001d68ec9a76436c1614fb111b32e558c1b16596820","source_hash":"1812ce9ddc1311606db8408565b52634a90d5a7e6fd62fbb391a08be52a8e585","text":"补充规定 <第888号，2022年1月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014227-239451-ko","scope":"BODY","start":343,"end":373,"target_id":"97cf862ddd6ea0bb7bab4463d22463e8231fdbca6e20b66808bbffcac7ab8b6b","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71